.TH IMPRO 1 "" "impro" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
impro \- IDE with explorer, editor, live Markdown notes and terminal docks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B impro
[\fB\-h\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIfolder\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the given project folder in the impro window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print the usage line and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
2 if the folder argument is not a directory.
